%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 51fb4c6070f247e48b4377b5728b8182, type: 3}
  m_Name: H9_X1_3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: Hey, Mr. Horse, there's a lady heading in our direction. Can you ask her
      where we are?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I can. Wait here.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I do as I'm told and watch from a distance how Mr. Horse approaches the
      stranger.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 3
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Wait, I'm stupid! Other people can't even see him, did I forget that already?
      I think I need to talk to her myself after all.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Just when I begin following Mr. Horse's tracks, I see how the woman's face
      turns in his direction. A wide smile lies on her lips, which turns into a slightly
      startled expression soon after.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Huh? There's no way she can see him, right? Mr. Horse said I was the first
      human he met that could. Even if she could, how would she even react to a horse-headed
      stranger approaching her in the middle of nowhere? I really did not think this
      through\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: The two meet and I can clearly see how the lady is in fact talking. I can't
      quite make out her words from the distance, but she seems to be a bit flustered
      by the situation.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: So she really can see him? What does this mean? Does she share some horse-sensing
      superpowers with me?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: I try to get a bit closer without drawing attention to myself. Still, their
      voices are faint and muffled. All I can understand are some disconnected strings
      of words.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "\u2026are worried sick\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "\u2026another place\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "\u2026what a relief\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e98f6dd1b5f6d3e4e87cd47b6a20f514, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "\u2026shining bright today\u2026"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: There is no way they are talking about the weather right now! Why are they
      chatting as if they were old friends?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: Soon they say their goodbyes and part ways with a small wave. The woman
      gives a slight bow before moving along. Mr. Horse returns with a fast pace.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: So my suspicions have been confirmed. Do not worry. I am still clueless
      about our exact circumstances, but I do know where we need to go now.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
    actions:
    - character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3db0785a05cdb804ead5133abfe270c1, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      type: 1
      position: {x: 0, y: 0}
      speed: 0
      targetScale: 0
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: What does he mean by that?
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4849dc22c0fc77f45b58cdfcf9fc156e, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: In the meantime, the woman has caught up with us as well. She shoots a
      quick smile while passing by, leaving some space between us and her.
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 221cb615d975cab419307e866ebd5c5c, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  - text: "Huh, which suspicions? And where did she say we are? You can't just\u2014"
    alternativeText: 
    character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d69d53562766de143bf061768e3de597, type: 2}
    actions: []
    music: {fileID: 0}
    sound: {fileID: 0}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 41de7d8911b06044eb1ffbfc63d6d72a, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 379f1568780542feb977d6e29e7a6ef8, type: 2}
